---
import SiteShell from '../layouts/SiteShell.astro';
---

<SiteShell title="webmaster - ohrt.dev">
  <img
    class="webmaster-photo"
    src="/images/webmaster.webp"
    width="555"
    height="629"
    alt="Oliver on a boat, grinning, holding a fishing rod"
  />
  <p>Hi, again. My name is Oliver Ohrt...</p>
  <p>
    I was born and raised in the Greater Seattle Area, Issaquah, for those from the region. I've been passionate about
    everything computers & machines since I could talk. From self-teaching Java at thirteen to graduating with a degree
    in CS from UW-Madison in December.
  </p>
  <p>
    At Madtown I helped run the{' '}
    <a href="https://upl.cs.wisc.edu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      Undergraduate Projects Lab
    </a>
    , a student-run lab that has been around since the 1980s, where I planned events and helped put on Wisconsin's
    largest hackathon, MadHacks. The last two summers I was in Bellevue at Amazon writing internal tools for the AGI
    org.
  </p>
  <p>
    Off my computer it's reading, cooking, fishing (see above), and music. I'm currently wrapping up Zen and the Art of
    Motorcycle Maintenance by Robert M. Pirsig.
  </p>
  <h2 class="section">About this site</h2>
  <p>
    This site is written in{' '}
    <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      Astro
    </a>{' '}
    and hosted on GitHub Pages, rebuilt by GitHub Actions on every push. The counter, contribution graph, changelog and
    sticky note are all fetched at build time from GoatCounter, GitHub, the git log and a Gist. The guestbook lives on
    atabook, the source code for the whole site is on{' '}
    <a href="https://github.com/Lavanic/ohrt.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      GitHub
    </a>
    .
  </p>
  <img
    class="webmaster-photo-2"
    src="/images/webmaster-2.webp"
    width="1370"
    height="1002"
    alt="Oliver in sunglasses under a stone arch in Venice"
  />
  <p>
    Still on the list: the Links page, a webring, something for Projects and Services, and actually writing the blog.
  </p>
  <h2 class="section">Find me</h2>
  <p>
    Email me at oliver@theohrts(dot)com, find me on{' '}
    <a href="https://github.com/Lavanic" target="_blank" rel="me noopener">
      GitHub
    </a>
    , read the{' '}
    <a href="https://blog.ohrt.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      weblog
    </a>
    , or <a href="/guestbook/">sign the guestbook</a> on your way out. The rest of my accounts are on{' '}
    <a href="/links/">Links</a>.
  </p>
  <div class="id-buttons no-mobile">
    <img src="/stickers/id/american.png" width="86" height="15" alt="American" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/cascadian.png" width="86" height="15" alt="Cascadian" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/college-student.png" width="86" height="15" alt="College student" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/programmer.png" width="86" height="15" alt="Programmer" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/engineer.png" width="86" height="15" alt="Engineer" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/archivist.png" width="86" height="15" alt="Archivist" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/explorer.png" width="86" height="15" alt="Explorer" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/gnu-linux.png" width="86" height="15" alt="GNU/Linux" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/git.png" width="86" height="15" alt="Git" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/firefox.png" width="86" height="15" alt="Firefox" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/java.png" width="86" height="15" alt="Java" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/c.png" width="86" height="15" alt="C" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/rust.png" width="86" height="15" alt="Rust" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/lua.png" width="86" height="15" alt="Lua" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/sql.png" width="86" height="15" alt="SQL" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/javascript.png" width="86" height="15" alt="JavaScript" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/typescript.png" width="86" height="15" alt="TypeScript" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/html5.png" width="86" height="15" alt="HTML5" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/css3.png" width="86" height="15" alt="CSS3" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/elden-ring.png" width="86" height="15" alt="Elden Ring" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/ffxiv.png" width="86" height="15" alt="FFXIV Player" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/smash-bros-brawl.png" width="86" height="15" alt="Super Smash Bros Brawl" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/solarpunk.png" width="86" height="15" alt="Solarpunk" />
    <img src="/stickers/id/cowboy.png" width="86" height="15" alt="Cowboy" />
  </div>
</SiteShell>

<style>
  .webmaster-photo {
    float: left;
    width: 230px;
    max-width: 48%;
    height: auto;
    margin: 4px 20px 6px 0;
  }

  .webmaster-photo-2 {
    float: right;
    width: 230px;
    max-width: 48%;
    height: auto;
    margin: 12px 0 10px 20px;
  }

  .webmaster-photo-2 + p {
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  :global(.panel-content) h2.section {
    clear: left;
    margin: 20px 0 6px;
    font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .id-buttons {
    --btn-gap: 3px;
    clear: both;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: var(--btn-gap);
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .id-buttons img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    image-rendering: pixelated;
  }

  .id-buttons img:nth-child(10n + 6),
  .id-buttons img:nth-child(10n + 7),
  .id-buttons img:nth-child(10n + 8),
  .id-buttons img:nth-child(10n + 9),
  .id-buttons img:nth-child(10n + 10) {
    transform: translateX(14px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1020px) {
    .webmaster-photo {
      width: 50%;
      max-width: none;
      margin: calc(4px / var(--scale)) calc(14px / var(--scale)) 0 0;
    }

    .webmaster-photo-2 {
      width: 50%;
      max-width: none;
      margin: calc(10px / var(--scale)) 0 calc(8px / var(--scale)) calc(14px / var(--scale));
    }

    .webmaster-photo-2 + p {
      margin-top: calc((14px - 6px * var(--phone)) / var(--scale));
    }

    :global(.panel-content) h2.section {
      margin: calc((20px - 8px * var(--phone)) / var(--scale)) 0 calc(6px / var(--scale));
      font-size: calc((20px - 9px * var(--phone)) / var(--scale));
      letter-spacing: calc(1px / var(--scale));
    }
  }
</style>
